em and asks him this guy she has never heard about, what the hell is going on. He asks her for her number so they can talk on the phone because he was under the thought Gawduss was a 17 year old girl from Or named bri terry. The girl friend which is now an EX tell him no his name is Brian terry from or. age 17. So at first he thinks its a boat load of ****. It turns out this girl knows everything. <br /><br />So this guy starts looking for Gawduss online yesterday. shes not online, asks some of her guildies, nope ain't seen her, emails gawduss saying what the hell is going on?<br /><br />In the end it turns out Gawduss is a 17 year old guy named Brian living in camas Oregon, using the name bri terry to get things that he could never get if people thought he was a guy.<br /><br />Signed<br />Someone that should let the truth come out.</span id="msg"></font></td>
